            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. What type of oxides are formed when non-metals combine with oxygen?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
