            0.396,
            0.494,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Sodium, potassium and lithium are stored under oil.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.428,
            0.495,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) Aluminium is a highly reactive metal, yet it is used to make utensils for cooking.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
