          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. You must have seen tarnished copper vessels being cleaned with lemon or tamarind juice. Explain why these sour substances are effective in cleaning the vessels.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.583,
            0.892,
            0.602
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. Differentiate between metal and non-metal on the basis of their chemical properties.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
